{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018E3ha3UjBwxhJayxdqLThG","type":"tool_result","content":"6: * J alone checks what is in front: doors (the door opens between rooms), things to take, the item box, the typewriter\n10: * right turn you. THE 3D: camera zones (world.camera.zones: fixed, one that turns after you, one on a rail), lock-on\n12: * failing bulb (world.flashlight), fog. HORROR.run(n): a scripted walk's hash (the proof); HORROR.bot(): to the boss\n16:  /* ---- THE WING: one character per 1-metre tile. Rooms: the foyer (the start, the typewriter and the item box), the\n19:   * q the brass key, c the crank, X the typewriter, Y the item box, O the crank's socket ---- */\n57:        '@': on(tiles, { mark: 'start' }), X: on(tiles, { mark: 'typewriter' }), Y: on(tiles, { mark: 'trunk' }), D: on(tiles, { mark: 'dog' }), c: on(tiles, { mark: 'crank' }), A: on(tiles, { mark: 'ammo' }),\n66:    { room: 'foyer', box: R(12.5, 24, 30.5, 29.5), at: [468, 458, 64], look: [324, 352, 0], fov: 52 },\n67:    { room: 'foyer', box: R(12.5, 13.5, 30.5, 24), at: [216, 228, 62], look: [380, 364, 0], fov: 52 },\n69:    { room: 'west', box: R(3.5, 17.5, 8.5, 21), at: [122, 396, 50], look: [96, 292, 0], fov: 56 },\n70:    { room: 'kitchen', box: R(0, 10.5, 12.5, 17.5), at: [184, 268, 58], look: [70, 196, 0], fov: 56 },\n72:    { room: 'east', box: R(30, 20.5, 35, 25.5), at: [490, 396, 50], look: [604, 360, 0], fov: 56 },\n74:    { room: 'library', box: R(30.5, 0, 37.5, 11.5), at: [504, 170, 62], look: [584, 52, 0], fov: 56 },\n75:    { room: 'library', box: R(37.5, 0, 46, 11.5), at: [716, 172, 62], look: [646, 60, 0], fov: 56 },\n131:    moan: { wave: 'saw', freq: 92, to: 70, dur: .9, vol: .1, vib: [5, .08], filter: 'lowpass' }, bark: [{ wave: 'saw', freq: 420, to: 240, dur: .09, vol: .18 }, { wave: 'saw', freq: 400, to: 200, dur: .1, vol: .16, delay: .14 }],\n133:    crank: { wave: 'square', freq: 300, arp: [0, 0, 0, 0], step: .09, dur: .36, vol: .12, filter: 'lowpass' }, stab: { wave: 'noise', freq: 3200, to: 900, dur: .09, vol: .22 },\n134:    roar: [{ wave: 'saw', freq: 120, to: 50, dur: 1.2, vol: .22, vib: [8, .15] }, { wave: 'noise', freq: 400, to: 100, dur: 1, vol: .2, filter: 'lowpass' }]\n141:  const SAFE = { bpm: 64, steps: 3, tracks: [   // the foyer: the typewriter's quiet, a waltz in the dark\n155:    world = new W3(game, { level: LEVEL, torchLights: 4, torchShadows: 0, torchPower: 22, torchReach: 140, torchColor: '#ffb070', lights: 1, spots: 1,\n156:      ambient: ['#3a3e56', '#141018', 1.6], fog: { color: '#040406', near: 40, far: 250 }, sky: '#020203', camera: { mode: 'zones', zones: ZONES, reticle: '#ff5a3a', lockRange: 170 },\n178:    world.thing('typewriter', world.marks.typewriter[0].x, world.marks.typewriter[0].y, 0, { yaw: PI / 2, solid: [22, 13, 16] });\n198:    world.camera.set('view'); world.camera.set('zones'); world.camera.follow(hero);\n201:  const alive = () => enemies.filter(e => e.alive && e.hp > 0);\n202:  const awake = () => alive().filter(e => e.room === H.room);\n279:  /** J in front of something: a door, a thing to take, the item box, the typewriter, the socket */\n300:    if (t.kind === 'typewriter') { saveGame(); return; }\n389:  /* ---- SAVES: the typewriter writes to the 2D engine's slots (game.saves); a door passed writes the autosave ---- */\n391:  function saveGame() { game.saves.write = state; game.saves.read = s => reset(1, s.data); if (!game.saves.show('save')) game.saves.save(0); }\n392:  function autosave() { if (!H.dead && !scripted) { game.saves.write = state; game.saves.autosave(); } }   // (not in the proof or the bot)\n505:  function run(n = 600) {\n519:    return world.hash([H.hp, H.clip, world.camera.cuts, ZONES.indexOf(Z), L ? enemies.indexOf(L) : -1, phase, enemies.filter(e => !e.alive).length]);\n541:        const foes = awake().filter(e => Math.hypot(e.x - hero.x, e.y - hero.y) < (e.type === 'boss' ? 200 : 120) && world.clear(hero.x, hero.y, hero.z + 16, e.x, e.y, e.z + 10));\n555:          if (inv.has('brasskey') && !saved) saved = game.saves.save(2, state());   // (a save on the way, loaded back at the end)\n570:    game.saves.read = s => reset(1, s.data); const back = saved && game.saves.load(2);\n572:    game.saves.erase(2); ended = 0; return r;\n579:      game.saves.write = state; game.saves.read = s => reset(1, s.data);\n580:      if (game.saves.any) { mode = 'intro'; menu = new E.Menu(game, ['CONTINUE', 'NEW GAME'], { y: 'center', onPick: i => { mode = 'play'; menu = null; if (i === 0) game.saves.load(game.saves.latest().slot); } }); }\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e34a208-b0be-46a3-80b7-32b0075578cc","uuid":"87d9f35f-7650-4466-8c10-3b6b781bdec1","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:54:31.467Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"6: * J alone checks what is in front: doors (the door opens between rooms), things to take, the item box, the typewriter\n10: * right turn you. THE 3D: camera zones (world.camera.zones: fixed, one that turns after you, one on a rail), lock-on\n12: * failing bulb (world.flashlight), fog. HORROR.run(n): a scripted walk's hash (the proof); HORROR.bot(): to the boss\n16:  /* ---- THE WING: one character per 1-metre tile. Rooms: the foyer (the start, the typewriter and the item box), the\n19:   * q the brass key, c the crank, X the typewriter, Y the item box, O the crank's socket ---- */\n57:        '@': on(tiles, { mark: 'start' }), X: on(tiles, { mark: 'typewriter' }), Y: on(tiles, { mark: 'trunk' }), D: on(tiles, { mark: 'dog' }), c: on(tiles, { mark: 'crank' }), A: on(tiles, { mark: 'ammo' }),\n66:    { room: 'foyer', box: R(12.5, 24, 30.5, 29.5), at: [468, 458, 64], look: [324, 352, 0], fov: 52 },\n67:    { room: 'foyer', box: R(12.5, 13.5, 30.5, 24), at: [216, 228, 62], look: [380, 364, 0], fov: 52 },\n69:    { room: 'west', box: R(3.5, 17.5, 8.5, 21), at