{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R63knJnirfuEhoNZ5xUKTb","type":"tool_result","content":"666:- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\n\n666:hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }\n442:- `r.glowMask = true` †: false lets emissive glows show over everything under canvas lighting (cheaper: the default keeps walls and bodies in front of a glow dark)\n1527:- `physics.ray(a, b, mask = 0xffff)`: the nearest body along the line from a to b (sensors aside; mask: the layers it sees): { body, x, y, t } or null\n1739:- `terrain.cells`: the mask, row by row from the top (0: air)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e34a208-b0be-46a3-80b7-32b0075578cc","uuid":"903fe09c-a6af-43f2-9f6b-142afabb2f1f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:57:13.768Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"666:- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\n\n666:hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }\n442:- `r.glowMask = true` †: false lets emissive glows show over everything under canvas lighting (cheaper: the default keeps walls and bodies in front of a glow dark)\n1