{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LfQX2f4F8C44TkkdQDyMH6","type":"tool_result","content":"18:| Pause menu (full engine) | a pausable scene pauses on Escape, P, Start, the touch START or the corner's menu button: Resume, Settings, Controls, Full screen, Help, Quit to title (asks first) | `menu: { items: [['Restart', fn]], quit: 'title' }` | `menu: false` (the canvas PAUSED overlay) |\n22:| Pausing by itself | a pausable scene pauses when the page is hidden, the window loses focus or the controller in use is unplugged; only the player resumes (`game.pauseReason`) | `game.pause(reason)`, `game.resume()` | `autoPause: false` |\n29:(its corner's menu button pauses and resumes). Emberdeep and the labs with panels of their own keep theirs (`menu: false,\n75:| 13 Pause | Pause reasons kept apart; focus never resumes; explicit resume | Emberdeep only | `pauseReason`; focus loss and unplugging pause, nothing resumes by itself | built in | `standard-test` |\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e34a208-b0be-46a3-80b7-32b0075578cc","uuid":"d8ab383a-ed9c-411d-b009-8479b670d00c","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:01:49.559Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"18:| Pause menu (full engine) | a pausable scene pauses on Escape, P, Start, the touch START or the corner's menu button: Resume, Settings, Controls, Full screen, Help, Quit to title (asks first) | `menu: { items: [['Restart', fn]], quit: 'title' }` | `menu: false` (the canvas PAUSED overlay) |\n22:| Pausing by itself | a pausable scene pauses when the page is hidden, the window loses focus or the controller in use is unplugged; only the player resumes (`game.pauseReason`) | `game.pause(reason)`, `game.resume()` | `autoPause: false` |\n29:(its corner's menu button pauses and resumes). Emberdeep and the labs with panels of their own keep theirs (`menu: false,\n75:| 13 Pause | Pause reasons kept apart; focus never resumes; explicit resume | Emberdeep only | `pauseReason`; focus loss and unplugging pause, nothing resumes by itself | built in | `standard-test` |","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LfQX2f4F8C44TkkdQDyMH6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
