{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RKWtx5n2d1sZHDT8HodoHb","type":"tool_result","content":"13: * on the gun); first person draws its arms and guns with the overlay's pen, which never sinks into a wall. Muzzle\n571:    const tmO = tm.clone(); tmO.colorNode = tm.colorNode; tmO.depthTest = false;   // (on the overlay a flash draws over the gun or the fist that made it)\n572:    fx.flW = flashMesh(world.scene, tm); fx.flO = flashMesh(world.overlay.scene, tmO);\n616:   *  (s 0: chips only); shards: chips thrown off it; ov: p is in the eye's frame, drawn on the overlay (over the fist that threw it) */\n1009:   *  the world's flashes or the overlay's (drawFlashes) by the pen that draws the gun */\n1011:    const q = pen === world.overlay.pen ? fx.flashes.ov : fx.flashes.world; if (q.length >= FL_MAX) return;\n1418:    // overlay over the fist (behind it in the world, the glove hid it); in third person on the body, chest high\n1697:   * FIRST PERSON: the arms and the gun in the overlay (its pen: x ahead of the eye, y right, z up, engine units),\n2012:    w.overlay.on = S.view === 'first' && S.alive;\n2013:    if (w.overlay.on) { w.overlay.camera.fov = lerp(54, 44, ease(S.adsB)); drawViewModel(w.overlay.pen, dt, cam); }\n2066:      torchLights: 0, glowLights: 4, lights: 3, overlay: { fov: 58 }, camera: { mode: 'fixed', capture: true, near: 1.2 }, res: 'balanced', gravity: GRAV, onDraw });\n2079:    draw(r) { world.draw(r); r.overlay(g => hud(g, r)); },\n2063:    world = new W3(game, { terrain: { size: SIZE, cell: 32, chunk: 32, height, color, far: 17000, physics: 1400, detail: 1.2, rock: { colors: ['#a8644a', '#c47e5a', '#8e523c', '#d0946a', '#b06e50', '#7a4632', '#c8885e'], band: 46, slope: [.34, .52] }, speckle: .2, mottle: .34 },\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e34a208-b0be-46a3-80b7-32b0075578