{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013f4soC7RKsRQ7AMWrL7KcN","type":"tool_result","content":"619:- `saves.autosave(o)` †: save to the autosave (what write() gives)\n623:- `saves.latest()` †: the most recent save that loads, or null (a title's Continue loads it)\n627:- `saves.show(mode = 'load', done)` †: open the standard save screen over the game (E.Shell's): 'save' (to a slot) or 'load'; done(save) after a load or a save. False without a menu (a headless game, menu: false)\n629:- `saves.canSave = true` †: the pause menu offers Save (a JRPG turns it off away from save points)\n633:- `saves.read` †: what a load does with { data, place, level, time, slot }\n636:- `saves.write` †: what a save holds ({ data, place, level })\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e34a208-b0be-46a3-80b7-32b0075578cc","uuid":"2a4a1ef7-8723-4987-b47e-b622f0bdc6f1","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:17:26.469Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"619:- `saves.autosave(o)` †: save to the autosave (what write() gives)\n623:- `saves.latest()` †: the most recent save that loads, or null (a title's Continue loads it)\n627:- `saves.show(mode = 'load', done)` †: open the standard save screen over the game (E.Shell's): 'save' (to a slot) or 'load'; done(save) after a load or a save. False without a menu (a headless game, menu: false)\n629:- `saves.canSave = true` †: the pause menu offers Save (a JRPG turns it off away from save points)\n633:- `saves.read` †: what a load does with { data, place, level, time, slot }\n636:- `saves.write` †: what a save holds ({ data, place, level })","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013f4soC7RKsRQ7AMWrL7KcN","permission_decision":{"