{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2PvkXJY7hrCEUU9kAM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JMf5jrP9hC6ZJzQ9ybXbsg","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/work/PLAN.md","old_string":"```\n                    [x1 stairwell door → 00B]  (Service Key)\n                              |\n                        [m1 mezzanine]\n                              | (stairs, 4 m up)\n [b2 bar back]—[b1 bar]—[g1 velvet rope]—[j3 stairs foot]\n  Service Key   phone,      (Rurik, 20 Red)    |\n  Rime crystal  Pin 1? no:               [j2 lobby centre]—[j4 elevators: Pim, Pin 1]\n                see j4                        |\n                       [s1 luggage rack: Murmel]—[j1 reception]—[r7 Room 7 door]\n                                              |\n                                   [d0 revolving door]  (storm: locked; Murmel jokes about it)\n```","new_string":"```\n                          [x1 stairwell door → 00B]  (needs the Service Key)\n                                    |\n                              [m1 mezzanine]\n                                    |  (stairs, 4 m up)\n [b2 bar back]—[b1 bar]—[g1 velvet rope]—[j3 stairs foot]\n                          (Rurik, 20 Red)    |\n                                       [j2 lobby centre]—[j4 elevators: Pim, Pin 1]\n                                             |\n              [s1 luggage rack: Murmel]—[j1 reception]—[r7 Room 7 door]\n                                             |\n                                  [d0 revolving door]  (storm: locked)\n```\nb2 holds the Service Key; b1 holds the bar phone and a Rime crystal (in the fireplace)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":73825,"cache_read_input_tokens":376425,"c